GAFI BoD shall convene at least once every month. GAFI BoD meeting may not be valid unless attended by at least two-thirds of GAFI BoD members. GAFI BoD may form from among the members thereof one or more committee(s) to be assigned a specific task. GAFI BoD Chairperson may, when necessary, invite those experts deemed thereby fit to attend the meetings. 
