Article 743 
GAFI BoD is the supreme authority governing GAFI's affairs. Pursuant to the provisions of this Law and the Executive Regulations thereof, GAFI BoD shall pass those resolutions deemed thereby necessary to realize the objects for which GAFI has been established, and shall, in particular: 
1. Set GAFI activity agenda and GAFI programs within the framework of the State's investment policy; 
2. Develop the mechanisms of activation of the ISC system, and follow up on the implementation thereof; 
3. Determine the consideration for the services rendered by GAFI; 
4. Adopt such internal regulations and implementing resolutions in respect of GAFI financial, administrative and technical affairs, and create the organizational structure thereof;

4. Adopt such internal regulations and implementing resolutions in respect of GAFI financial, administrative and technical affairs, and create the organizational structure thereof; 
